= Conclusion
The md2pdf Rust rewrite successfully implements the core features needed for markdown to PDF conversion:

+ *Complete Markdown Support*: All CommonMark features plus extensions
+ *Professional Output*: Cover pages, TOC, headers/footers
+ *Advanced Features*: Math equations, code highlighting, callouts
+ *Layout Control*: Page breaks, column layouts

